Thank you for the clarification Steve and Eric.

Indeed, we visited the transects multiple times (4 repeats per year during 5 years) which explains the high number of detections.
We compared different models with different covariates and it is the one with transect as a factor covariate that fits the best (perhaps explained by local habitat differences between the transects).

Cheers
