I have the following data: Region (my study site), Region (area of study site in hectares), Point transect (my point names), Point transect (survey effort (how many times each point was counted)), Observation (species name, radial distance, number of each species counted, observer initials, and cloud cover).

Have I placed my data in correct fields on the data import wizard?

